OL,3,GNEWSADriver arrested after boy hit by
OL,4,Acar
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver has been arrested after a
OL,7,Fchild was hit by a car in a Greater
OL,8,FManchester town.
OL,10,FThe young boy, understood to be aged
OL,11,Fabout five, was hit in King Street in
OL,12,FHeywood at about 15:10 BST on Thursday
OL,13,Fand taken to hospital with a broken
OL,14,Fleg, police said.
OL,16,FGreater Manchester Fire and Rescue
OL,17,FService said they also attended to
OL,18,Fassist police and make the area safe.
OL,20,FThe driver of the car was arrested on
OL,21,Fsuspicion of possessing a Class A drug,
OL,22,FGreater Manchester Police said.
